#. Story-only instructions for reproducing the Composer clipboard defect
#: src/storybook/composer/ClipboardFailurePreview.tsx:39
msgid "A Skill node is selected. Press Cmd/Ctrl+C or X. This story makes document.execCommand('copy') return false. The Composer shows no failure feedback; the DEV area only observes and displays unhandledrejection. A failed cut should preserve the content. Switching stories restores the browser method."
msgstr "A Skill node is selected. Press Cmd/Ctrl+C or X. This story makes document.execCommand('copy') return false. The Composer shows no failure feedback; the DEV area only observes and displays unhandledrejection. A failed cut should preserve the content. Switching stories restores the browser method."

